{"suttaId":"tha-ap480","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[1741,1755],"vripara":"66"},"segments":{"tha-ap480:0.3":"Vallikāraphaladāyakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap480:1.1":"“Sumano nāma sambuddho, takkarāyaṃ vasī tadā;","tha-ap480:1.3":"Vallikāraphalaṃ gayha, sayambhussa adāsahaṃ.","tha-ap480:2.1":"“Ekatiṃse ito kappe, yaṃ phalaṃ adadiṃ tadā;","tha-ap480:2.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, phaladānassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap480:3.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap480:4.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap480:5.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap480:6.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā vallikāraphaladāyako thero imā Gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap480:7.1":"Vallikāraphaladāyakattherassāpadānaṃ aṭṭhamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
